# Build context hygiene.
#
# The image only needs the sources: the Mini App (package.json + src) and the
# Go backend. Everything generated, installed or secret stays out so the
# context is small and a Windows checkout cannot leak host binaries into the
# Linux image.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/bin
**/var
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.log
**/.git
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/design/stitch/*.png
**/design/stitch/*.html
